# Shemá — Projetos (BE-05 · OBT-394)
#
# One endpoint behind the whole screen: the scoped collection, the twenty-one filters it
# offers, the sixteen facet groups the sidebar counts, the four presets, five orders and a
# window. The parameter names are the console's own URL parameters
# (src/utils/filterSerialisation.ts), so a saved view's link and a request here are the same
# string.
#
# Two things to know before running anything below:
#   * every response carries `counts`, including the unfiltered one — there is no way to ask
#     for the filter alone;
#   * a project in a sensitive country comes back with its region where its country would be,
#     and the `country` facet counts it the same way. That is not an error in the fixture.
#
# Before running: seed the app and its roles, grant one, and give the account a region.
#   uv run python scripts/seed_apps_roles.py
#   uv run python scripts/grant_app_role.py coord.local@test.com shema coordinator
# A regional role with no region granted reaches nothing, on purpose — grant the region
# through the module's own path (app/services/shema/set_region_scope.py), or grant
# `globalStrategist` instead, which reaches every region.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@appKey = shema
@accessToken = {{shema_login.response.body.tokens.access_token}}

### Login — named, so every request below reuses the token
# @name shema_login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coord.local@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Session — who the caller is and how far they reach (BE-03)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/session
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The whole scoped collection, with every facet count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One filter — the counts in the other fifteen groups narrow with it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?status=em-andamento
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filters compose, across five different shapes of group
# A stored enum, a derived value, a JSON array, a child-table join and free text.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?status=em-andamento&health=critica&objective=NT&needCategory=equipment&q=guarani
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### "Sem notícias 60+ dias" — atencao OR critico, not the [60, 120) bucket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?stale=atencao
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The same filter's strict half
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?stale=critico
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Presets — a comma list, exactly as the screen's URL writes it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?presets=attention,recent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The Início screen's "urgent" indicator, which is this request and no endpoint of its own
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?presets=attention
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A page, ordered — `total` and `counts` still describe the whole filtered set
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?sort=health&limit=24&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?sort=health&limit=24&offset=24
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The five orders: deadline (default), name, progress, team, health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?sort=name
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A region — the scope already refuses the ones the caller cannot reach
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?continent=africa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### An option no record answers to — an empty list, never a 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?objective=Xyz
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A misspelled parameter — 422, because a filter that silently does not apply is worse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects?contintent=africa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### No token — 401 before any of the above is considered
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/projects
